Package: deck
Title: Slide Builders for the Sage Mint PowerPoint Template
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Joe", "Crowley", email = "joeac121@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A small set of helpers that wrap 'officer' to place titles, text,
    tables and charts onto the layouts of the bundled "Sage Mint Theme"
    PowerPoint template. Also provides 'flextable' helpers for preparing
    tables sized to the template's table area, and 'mschart' builders for
    native, editable Office charts in the NatCen house style.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2)
Imports:
    flextable,
    mschart,
    officer
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
